{"v":1,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","layout":"pages","chapters":[{"id":"cover","title":"Zama is great!","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/01.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"h","x":"Zama is great!"}]},{"id":"p1","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/02.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"My little brother sleeps very late. I wake early, because I am great!"}]},{"id":"p2","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/03.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I am the one who lets in the sun."}]},{"id":"p3","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/04.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"\"You're my morning star,\" says Ma."}]},{"id":"p4","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/05.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I wash myself, I don't need any help."}]},{"id":"p5","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/06.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I can cope with cold water and blue smelly soap."}]},{"id":"p6","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/07.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"Ma reminds, \"Don't forget teeth.\" I reply, \"Never, not me!\""}]},{"id":"p7","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/08.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"After washing, I greet Grandpa and Auntie, and wish them a good day."}]},{"id":"p8","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/09.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"Then I dress myself, \"I'm big now Ma,\" I say."}]},{"id":"p9","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/10.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I can close my buttons and buckle my shoes."}]},{"id":"p10","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/11.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"And I make sure little brother knows all the school news."}]},{"id":"p11","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/12.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"In class I do my best in every way."}]},{"id":"p12","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0095/13.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I do all these good things every day. But the thing I like most, is to play and play!"}]}]}